<div class="mandarin-hanzi">钱包</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">qiánbāo</div>

''Meaning:'' wallet  
''Part of speech:'' noun

!! In context
我的钱包在包里。 — Wǒ de qiánbāo zài bāo lǐ. — My wallet is in the bag.

!! Usage note
钱包 (qiánbāo) is a wallet; 包 (bāo) alone is a broader 'bag'. In 钱包在包里 (Qiánbāo zài bāo lǐ), the wallet is inside the bag.
